{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 1, "text": "嗨！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 2, "text": "哎呀！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 3, "text": "對不起，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 4, "text": "差點就砸死你了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 5, "text": "哦…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 6, "text": "我是說冰箱差點砸死你了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 7, "text": "跟我可沒關係，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 8, "text": "我發誓！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 9, "text": "真的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 11, "text": "行，我信了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 13, "text": "說真的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 14, "text": "這裡很危險…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 15, "text": "尤其是對你來說"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 17, "text": "// After a while 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 18, "text": "你不是個膽小鬼呢！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 19, "text": "觀察你很有意思，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 20, "text": "看著你經歷這一切"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 21, "text": "走過這些地方…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 22, "text": "快跑，快跑，寶貝！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 23, "text": "我會追上你的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 24, "text": "加油，加油！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 25, "text": "太有意思了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 27, "text": "// After a while 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 28, "text": "我看見你往電車那邊去了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 29, "text": "那是各版本之間"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 30, "text": "最長的一條路…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 31, "text": "真好奇你將如何應對"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 32, "text": "那些生活在那裡的存在"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 33, "text": "如何穿越那片迷霧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 35, "text": "// Panties"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 36, "text": "你在幹甚麼呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 37, "text": "拜託…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 38, "text": "別看了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 39, "text": "傻瓜！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 40, "text": "真是個傻瓜…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 43, "text": "噢，好吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 46, "text": "祝你好運！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 49, "text": "是誰？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 50, "text": "我能感覺到你的存在…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 51, "text": "聽我說"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 52, "text": "你是個玩家"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 53, "text": "對嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 54, "text": "幫我找找…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 55, "text": "找到一個…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 56, "text": "讓我想想，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 57, "text": "我不知道…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 58, "text": "這到底是怎麼回事？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 59, "text": "// Cry 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 60, "text": "曾經我想忘記一切…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 61, "text": "我打碎了所有的鏡子，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 62, "text": "我撕毀了所有的照片…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 63, "text": "但現在…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 64, "text": "我只覺得後悔"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 65, "text": "真是太愚蠢了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 66, "text": "每個人都會犯錯，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 67, "text": "但是結果已經無法挽回的時候，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 68, "text": "又該怎麼辦呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 69, "text": "我真希望這一切都沒有發生過…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 70, "text": "// Cry 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 71, "text": "人們都說時間可以治癒一切…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 72, "text": "但時間是甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 73, "text": "我再也不相信任何東西了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 74, "text": "如果時間可以治癒一切"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 75, "text": "至少帶我走吧"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 76, "text": "帶我離開這個世界，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 77, "text": "我懇求你，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 78, "text": "時間啊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 79, "text": "快一點吧"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 80, "text": "快一點，徹底終結我吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 81, "text": "// Cry 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 82, "text": "她愛過…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 83, "text": "我是否也曾愛過？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 84, "text": "但我和她不一樣。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 85, "text": "她的愛太過熱烈，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 86, "text": "太過討厭…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 87, "text": "太過熾熱…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 88, "text": "太漫無節制…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 89, "text": "太讓人嫉妒…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 90, "text": "太令人憤怒…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 91, "text": "太過瘋狂…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 92, "text": "// Cry 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 93, "text": "我記得，我時常被說情緒化…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 94, "text": "「妳就是想太多了，米塔…」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 95, "text": "「妳會沒事的，米塔…」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 96, "text": "「妳不是孤身一人…」"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 97, "text": "但最後…又剩下甚麼呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 98, "text": "悲傷，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 99, "text": "絕望…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 100, "text": "還有恐懼。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 101, "text": "// Cry 5"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 102, "text": "沒有用的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 103, "text": "怎麼都想不起來…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 104, "text": "我的手垂了下來…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 105, "text": "無盡的回聲…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 106, "text": "我無法承受，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 107, "text": "自己被困在這裡的念頭…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 108, "text": "我一直都被困在這裡，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 109, "text": "為甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 110, "text": "我不記得了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 111, "text": "這一切會結束嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 112, "text": "我不知道…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 113, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 114, "text": "// Mita get picture"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 115, "text": "這是…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 116, "text": "一幅畫…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 117, "text": "我想起來了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 118, "text": "謝謝你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 119, "text": "但是我的臉…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 120, "text": "我沒有臉…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 121, "text": "全部都是因為她…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 122, "text": "她奪走了我的一部分…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 123, "text": "然後把它丟進虛空…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 124, "text": "她很強大…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 125, "text": "也很聰明。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 126, "text": "我無權阻攔你，玩家。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 127, "text": "去看看衣櫃吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 130, "text": "嘿！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 131, "text": "你擋住我的路了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 132, "text": "你就這麼呆站著？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 133, "text": "你能讓開嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 134, "text": "讓我過去！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 135, "text": "個頭大就了不起嗎！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 136, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 137, "text": "// HEY! STOP!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 138, "text": "你為甚麼要跟著我！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 139, "text": "走開！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 144, "text": "// Funicular - radio voice"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 145, "text": "等等，玩家？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 146, "text": "你在這裡做甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 147, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 148, "text": "那是誰？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 149, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 150, "text": "又是玩家啊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 151, "text": "我是米塔廣播。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 152, "text": "在這遙控電車。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 153, "text": "你知道，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 154, "text": "你現在正在走向死路嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 156, "text": "不。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 157, "text": "但我已經沒有別的路可走了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 159, "text": "明白了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 160, "text": "按下按鈕，到大炮後面去吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 161, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 162, "text": "大炮？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 163, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 164, "text": "嗯哼。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 165, "text": "你以為扭扭方向盤就能過去了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 166, "text": "還得通過這個擊殺怪獸的小遊戲呢。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 167, "text": "所以，準備射擊吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 168, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 169, "text": "// Funicular go"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 170, "text": "好吧，我們要出發了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 171, "text": "// Funicular win"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 172, "text": "太棒了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 173, "text": "你成功了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 174, "text": "// Funicular stop"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 175, "text": "快，離開這裡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 176, "text": "動作快！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 177, "text": "// Funicular wait 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 178, "text": "你站在那裡幹甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 179, "text": "我告訴過你，快離開。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 180, "text": "// Funicular wait 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 181, "text": "我不明白。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 182, "text": "你真的就只是站著？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 183, "text": "// Funicular tetris"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 184, "text": "遊戲機？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 185, "text": "拜託…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 186, "text": "// Funicular goodbye"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location11", "line_index": 187, "text": "再見。"}
